.TH "STREAMING AND SERIALIZATION FUNCTIONS FOR PSTRINGS." "3" "" "pstring 1.5" "pstring manual"
.SH NAME
Streaming and serialization functions for pstrings. \- The pf_stream_t object can be used as a generic interface for interacting with byte streams.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fB#include <io.h>\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pstrreadall(pstring_t *out, const char *path);\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pstrwriteall(const pstring_t *str, const char *path);\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pstrio_printf(pstring_t *dst, const char *fmt, ...);\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pstrio_vprintf(pstring_t *dst, const char *fmt, va_list args);\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pf_stream_pstring(pf_stream_t *out, pstring_t *str);\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBint pf_stream_putp(pf_stream_t *stream, const pstring_t *str);\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The \fBpf_stream_t\fR object can be used as a generic interface for interacting
with byte streams. Unlike standard library \fBFILE\fR, \fBpf_stream_t\fR objects
can use user\-defined stream implementations such as network sockets,
in\-memory buffers, encoders and serializers.
.PP
This header also provides powerful serialization and deserialization
mechanisms through the \fBpstrmodel\fR and associated structures.
.SH REFERENCE
.SS pstrreadall
.PP
Concatenates the contents of the file onto the end of \fBout\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, ENOMEM, EIO.
.SS pstrwriteall
.PP
Writes the entire string \fBout\fR to the file at \fBpath\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, EIO.
.SS pstrio_printf
.PP
Concatenates string formated by standard library functions to \fBdst\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, ENOMEM, EIO.
.SS pstrio_vprintf
.PP
Concatenates string formated by standard library functions to \fBdst\fR.
Arguments are passed as a variable arguments list from \fB<stdarg.h>\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, ENOMEM, EIO.
.SS pf_stream_pstring
.PP
Initializes a stream that will read and write to the buffer
of \fBstr\fR, expanding it if needed. \fBstr\fR will NOT be freed by
the stream when closing.
.PP
Stream cursor will be at the end of the string.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, EIO.
.SS pf_stream_putp
.PP
Writes a \fBpstring_t\fR to \fBstream\fR.
.PP
\fBErrors\fR
.PP
EINVAL, EIO.
